+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on a transport compression codec. A search of the repository's documentation (README, CHANGELOG, `docs/doc.md`) and its history turned up no policy, ADR, or decision record naming a specific codec for transport compression; the README only lists compression as a supported middleware capability without committing to one, so no codec should be assumed until a decision is recorded here.
